'' 'tiko check' (tiko-build B5): every diagnostic a build would give through lowering, and
'' nothing written -- no object, no link, no lock. Here, the one error, exit 1, and no exe.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TKO_MODCACHE=build/.bck/cache
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.bck
'' ARGS: check -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/build-err/good.tiko tests/driver/src/build-err/bad.tiko -o build/.bck/app.exe
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: bad.tiko(3,11): error TKO0743: 'nosuchname' is not declared
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 1
'' EXPECT-NO-FILE: build/.bck/app.exe
